{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >E.Y.E.R.I.S. is a short, experimental, twin stick shooter that presents the player with subjective visual choices that when selected, change the way the game is played. Each choice will have both an immediate and delayed affect on gameplay. Examples of these changes are:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What weapon you are equipped with</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your health amount</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies you will face</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level modifiers</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some choices have obvious immediate effects, and some are left to be discovered. Once a choice is made, you will have to survive waves of enemies and complete goals to progress further in the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your own meaning for the decisions you make, and uncover the changes they cause.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everything You Experience Rests In Subjectivity</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4029700?t=1765919631","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4029700?t=1765919631","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4029700/6ad1e3c05c6b2d013eb9a35c73eb9c8fb2c83d83/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1765919631","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4029700/6ad1e3c05c6b2d013eb9a35c73eb9c8fb2c83d83/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1765919631","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >E.Y.E.R.I.S. is a short, experimental, twin stick shooter that presents the player with subjective visual choices that when selected, change the way the game is played. Each choice will have both an immediate and delayed affect on gameplay. Examples of these changes are:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What weapon you are equipped with</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your health amount</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies you will face</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level modifiers</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some choices have obvious immediate effects, and some are left to be discovered. Once a choice is made, you will have to survive waves of enemies and complete goals to progress further in the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your own meaning for the decisions you make, and uncover the changes they cause.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everything You Experience Rests In Subjectivity</p>","developers":["AbstrAKT Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4029700/a0e20b51afc05ca311d348fce216a16c2824d176/header.jpg?t=1765919631","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4029700/560199216/20d8fbd8378fb41ed1178ec9d3cdc043bb03b618/1759447140/dash_av1.mpd?t=1759448107","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4029700/560199216/20d8fbd8378fb41ed1178ec9d3cdc043bb03b618/1759447140/dash_h264.mpd?t=1759448107","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4029700/560199216/20d8fbd8378fb41ed1178ec9d3cdc043bb03b618/1759447140/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1759448107","id":257211074,"name":"E.Y.E.R.I.S. Trailer",